Package: mctmref
Type: Package
Title: Multivariate Conditional Reference and Tolerance Regions via
        Transformation Models
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2025-03-22
Authors@R: c(
    person("Oscar", "Lado-Baleato",
           email = "ladooscar@uniovi.es",
           role  = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Thomas", "Kneib",
           email = "tkneib@uni-goettingen.de",
           role  = "aut"))
Description: Estimates bivariate conditional reference regions and tolerance
    regions based on Multivariate Conditional Transformation Models (MCTMs),
    following Lado-Baleato et al. (2023) <doi:10.1002/bimj.202200229>.
    Provides functions to fit MCTMs, compute marginal conditional percentile
    curves, estimate bivariate reference and tolerance regions conditional on
    covariates, obtain joint Z-scores and decorrelated residuals, evaluate
    the joint log-likelihood, compute Mahalanobis distances, and perform
    leave-one-out cross-validation coverage checks. All functions use only
    documented generics from the underlying packages, making the
    implementation robust to future API changes.
